# @role          Immutable Canonical Ground Truth Ontology Baseline
# @witness       "In the beginning God created the heaven and the earth."
#                — Genesis 1:1 (KJV)
#                "Through wisdom is an house builded; and by understanding it
#                 is established..." — Proverbs 24:3 (KJV)
#
# THE 7-LAYER MORPHOLOGICAL DESCENT OF REALITY & COMPUTATION:
#   Layer 1: Top-Level Domain    (The 15 Sovereign Modal Spheres)
#   Layer 2: Category            (The Regional Sphere / System Module)
#   Layer 3: SubDomain           (The Specific Ontological Field / Habitat)
#   Layer 4: SubCategory         (The Functional Branch / Specialization)
#   Layer 5: Terms & Concepts    (The Schema, Vocabulary, and Attributes)
#   Layer 6: What "Something" IS (The Concrete Entity, Essence, Form - Noun)
#   Layer 7: Free-Standing Op    (The Action, Causation, Choice, Verb - Operator)
#
# WHY THE 7TH LAYER IS A FREE-STANDING OPERATION:
#   Layers 1 to 6 build the container and answer "WHAT IS IT?". Layer 7 answers
#   "WHAT DOES IT DO?". An operation cannot be locked inside the internal
#   taxonomy of an entity; it is the free causal vector that moves energy,
#   state, and intent between boundaries. It is also the locus of moral choice
#   and free agency, mirroring the 7th Day Sabbath of rest and communion.
#
# RECORD SCHEMAS:
#   DOMAIN|<id>|<num>|<symbol>|<title>|<normative_law>|<description>
#   CATEGORY|<id>|<domain_id>|<title>|<description>
#   SUBDOMAIN|<id>|<category_id>|<domain_id>|<rank>|<quad_state>|<title>|<system_scope>|<normative_rule>
#   SUBCATEGORY|<id>|<subdomain_id>|<title>|<description>
#   CONCEPT|<id>|<subdomain_id>|<title>|<definition>
#   ENTITY|<id>|<subdomain_id>|<denotation>|<what_it_is>
#   OPERATION|<id>|<free_standing_action>|<directional_vector>|<purpose>
# =============================================================================

