# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LAYER 7: FREE-STANDING OPERATIONS (VERBS, CAUSAL VECTORS, FREE ACTIONS)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Note: Layer 7 is free-standing. It is not locked inside an entity's container.
# It acts across boundaries, transferring causal energy and expressing agency.
OPERATION|ActUpon|DirectionalCausation|-->|Forward causal push of data or energy from Subject to Object.
OPERATION|ActAgain|RetroactiveFeedback|<--|Retroactive reflection, retry, transaction rollback, or query.
OPERATION|BuildsTo|AscendingSynthesis|--^|Synthesizing low-level concrete parts into higher-order abstraction.
OPERATION|BreaksDownFrom|DescendingDecomposition|--v|Lowering high-level declarative syntax into silicon machine code.
OPERATION|IsEquivalent|OntologicalEquivalence|<=>|Bijective transduction across dual substrates without data loss.
OPERATION|AssertGood|EvaluationVerification|==|Evaluating state against invariants: 'God saw that it was good'.
OPERATION|SabbathRest|CommunionRestoration|//~|Ceasing formative labor to enter contemplation, rest, and communion.
